{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-09-08 17:00:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. JOINS S&P 500', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., SEPT. 08, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO) ANNOUNCES THAT S&P DOW JONES INDICES REPORTED ON SEPTEMBER 3, 2021, THAT THE COMPANY WOULD BE INCLUDED IN THE PRESTIGIOUS S&P 500 INDEX EFFECTIVE PRIOR TO THE OPEN OF TRADING ON MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 20, 2021.'}